{"suttaId":"tha-ap213","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7602,7618],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap213:0.3":"Hatthidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap213:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, dvipadindassa tādino;","tha-ap213:1.3":"Nāgaseṭṭho mayā dinno, īsādanto urūḷhavā.","tha-ap213:2.1":"“Uttamatthaṃ anubhomi, santipadamanuttaraṃ;","tha-ap213:2.3":"Nāgadānaṃ [aggadānaṃ (sī. ka.)] mayā dinnaṃ, sabbalokahitesino.","tha-ap213:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ nāga [dāna (sī. ka.)] madadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap213:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, nāgadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap213:4.1":"“Aṭṭhasattatikappamhi, soḷasāsiṃsu khattiyā;","tha-ap213:4.3":"Samantapāsādikā nāma, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap213:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap213:5.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap213:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā hatthidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap213:7.1":"Hatthidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
